<!--
  fixture kind: reduced
  source: skoba/anlage spec/fixtures/opt/jp_referral.opt at commit
          a376bc4 (the file was last changed there by d48d2f2; sha256 of
          that blob 5ffc7e6dac891d9263c8360cc8380c4861b22293a59c71cc967e203322d4f924).
          That file is jp_referral v0.2, a real Archetype Designer export
          which its own comment traces to
          skoba/openehr-templates-jp@09187226bd735246a36044597935b4c891a74c7b.
          Pinned to that version: later revisions of the template are
          deliberately not followed.
  reduction: the source's own leading comment is replaced by this one,
          and source lines 267-4209 are deleted - three sibling
          C_ARCHETYPE_ROOT children of the SECTION's items attribute
          (INSTRUCTION.service_request.v1 with its nested CLUSTER roots,
          EVALUATION.problem_diagnosis.v1, OBSERVATION.story.v1).
          Nothing else is edited. What remains: the COMPOSITION root, the
          SECTION root, and the two EVALUATION.clinical_synopsis.v1 roots
          the template embeds side by side under the same items attribute,
          renamed per root (at0000 and at0002: 症状経過及び検査結果 / 治療経過).
  used by: opt_per_root_terminology_spec.rb (issue #58)
-->
